 "text": "9/29/26, 9:42 AM\n\nEstimation\n\nPurpose\n\nThis component allows you to estimate meter reading results automatically in the case of missing meter readings or implausible\nconsumption.\n\nImplementation considerations\n\nThis component is optional.\n\nProcess Implausible Meter Reading Results Using Machine\nLearning\n\nMachine learning can be used to process implausible meter reading results.\n\nIn this context, the machine learning functionality covers the following areas:\n\ne Provision of training and apply-relevant datasets to access and utilize machine learning-relevant information for\nimplausible meter reading results\n\ne Enabling of the Intelligent Scenario Lifecycle Management (ISLM) to define an active predictive model for the predictive\nscenario UTI_MR_IMPLAUSIBLE.\n\ne Determination of the release confidence values for implausible meter reading results.\ne Automatic release of implausible meter reading results, based on the release confidence against a given threshold.\n\ne Display the release confidence in the Fiori app Resolve Implausible Meter Readings. The relevant documentation can be\nfound at |help.sap.com/utilities \u00bb Product Assistance (SAP S/4HANA 1909 or more recent) \u00bb Apps for SAP Utilities\nResolve Implausible Meter Readings\n\nFor more information, see the chapter Machine Learning for SAP Utilities.\n\nReversal\n\nUse\n\nReversing meter reading deletes all objects generated during creation of meter reading orders and entry of meter reading results:\n\ne Meter reading orders\n\ne Meter reading results (optional)\n\ne Billing orders\n\nReversal may be necessary in the following cases:\n",
